# gt shows the Today view: tasks due today or earlier and starred tasks, each with its project path.
file <<END
Work:
	- Pay rent @due({today-3})
	- Send report @due({today})
	- Plan sprint @due({today+2})
	- Ship it @star
Home:
	- Fix sink
END
keys gt
see Today
see - Pay rent  Work
see - Send report  Work
see - Ship it
hide Plan sprint
hide Fix sink
quit
